  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14096328/assets/1ae6fd567aa4a7ce40a47e64e682bf2e908ab503e400bf47c27df06f87a57a96.png)     \n                                \n                            \n\n   \n\n                            Write the solid $R$ bounded by the duct $S$ as a type I region in three-dimensional space.\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $R={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,y)\\in D,\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,\\le z\\le \\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-2}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$},$ where\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $D={(x,y)\\,:\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-3}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,\\le x\\le \\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-4}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$,\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-5}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,\\le y\\le \\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-6}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$}.$",
  "worked_solution": "A typical three-dimensional type I region can be visualized schematically, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14096328/assets/05f940e247c6cd5d862d81fc3a34658353bef5513dfe862bbc67a120c0345838.png)\n\nFirst, the projection $D$ of the solid onto the $xy$-plane gives the domain\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,0\\le y\\le 2}.\n$$\n\nNext, we have\n\n- the *bottom* surface $z={f}_{1}(x,y)=0,$ and\n\n- the *top* surface $z={f}_{2}(x,y)=4.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14096328/assets/69faebe379efc8a012346b8aba235edca8e9d5adabd3bb52b5009c20d73de655.png)\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,y)\\in D,\\,0\\le z\\le 4\\,}.\n$$",
